 bytes, turbo-stream","+  `decode` 2477, seroval `fromJSON` 3425, flatted `parse` 377,","+  `JSON.parse` baseline 32. Millitags' core was 3519 bytes, so each of","+  the first three is more than half of a core bundle (devalue alone","+  adds 56 percent), and all four are larger than its hand-written","+  reviver, which measured under 250 bytes.","+","+Conclusion: the payload stays narrow and `JSON.parse` stays the","+reviver. The duplication costs roughly the payload's own compressed","+size, so keeping `AppState` to the values the page needs keeps that","+cost small; and no general deserializer is worth its bytes when","+`AppState` holds JSON values only. This is what the Decision above","+already says."]}]}],"moreFiles":0,"changedFiles":["/Users/nick/code/microtags.millitags-lessons-11-adr-008-note-with-measurements/docs/adr/ADR-008-serialized-server-state.md"]}},"tool_result_meta":[{"id":"toolu_01W6v14pJUJ9av587M783Ky5","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"mode"}}]}
